{"id":"seed_pct_mp_1","sectionId":"QA","topicId":"qa_percentages","topic":"Percentages","difficulty":"Easy","type":"MCQ","question":"A shirt is sold for ₹800 after a 20% discount on its marked price. What was the marked price?","options":["A) ₹960","B) ₹1000","C) ₹1024","D) ₹1040"],"correct":"B","concept":"Reverse percentage (price before discount)","solution":"MP × (1 − 0.20) = 800 ⇒ MP × 0.8 = 800 ⇒ MP = 800 / 0.8 = ₹1000.","source":"seed"}
